      "description": "Total is the span's whole duration. Self is that minus the union of its awaited children, so a parent waiting on a slow call shows a big total and a small self, and the slow call shows the self. Sum of self times never counts a wait twice.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "ms", "decimals": 0 },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "self share" },
